  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……やっぱり、納得いかない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──えっ、わらび餅パフェは邪道だったかな……！？\r\nＰたん頼み直す……！？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、いや、注文の話じゃないんだ、すまん！\r\nわらび餅パフェは俺も食べたいよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……えーと\r\nじゃあ、何が納得いかないの……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……結華、今日現場で言われてただろ\r\n『今の役がピッタリだ』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが、悔しくてさ\r\n結華はひとつしかできないわけじゃないのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……──！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、今の役がはまっているのはわかる\r\n結華に任せておけば間違いないだろうってことも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、そうじゃない届け方だってできるはずで、\r\n俺はそういう結華も知ってもらいたい",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華のいろんな魅力を、たくさんの人に見てもらいたい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……だから、\r\n上手いこと営業できてない自分に納得がいかなくて──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……ふふっ、やっぱり",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーは、\r\n三峰をやる気にさせる天才だよね",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……三峰はさ、三峰のことなんて、\r\nきっと誰にもわかってもらえないって思ってたし",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もし、大事な人からわかってもらえたとしたら、\r\nそれは奇跡だと思ってたし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……わかってもらいたい人にだけわかってもらえてたら、\r\nそれで十分って思ってた",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──でも。それが今回の結果につながったんだったら、\r\nこのままじゃいられないなーとも思ったの",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたん見てたら\r\n……わかってもらえる努力をしなきゃって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……ううん\r\n努力をしたいなって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは──",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "──……！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "嬉しい\r\n感想だなぁ……！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "結華だから──！",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040190,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やーめーてー？\r\nその噛みしめてますって顔",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "恥ずかしいこと言ってる時は、さらっと流す\r\nこれ鉄則ですよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……恥ずかしいこと、か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうに決まってるじゃん",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "言ったらＰたん喜んでくれるだろうなーってわかってる、\r\n恥ずかしい発言だよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふ、そう言うと思ったぁ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……まーったくさぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "『こういうのガラじゃない』ってこと言いすぎて、\r\nもうこれが三峰のガラってことになっちゃいそう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……たくさん、教えてくれてるもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……そこで、素直になった～とか\r\nわかりやすくなった～とか言わないところ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だぁいすき",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040270",
    "autoWaitTime": 2200
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう思えること自体が、結華の──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はーいちょっとストップ\r\nこの件についてはこれ以上しゃべるの禁止",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？\r\nなんでだ……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰は、ただただＰたんに聞かせるためだけに言ったので\r\nそれに対する感想なんか求めてないんだよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だから受け付けませーん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そんな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "諦めて大人しくわらび餅パフェを待ちましょう",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701004/2007010040310"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2300
  },
  {
    "id": 2007010040320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……改まって真面目な話より\r\n食べながらバカ話の方が性に合ってるんだからさ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
